        uint beforeAccBal = c.Acc(address(this)).balance; // public getter returns Holder struct? Solidity auto-generated getter for mapping to struct returns fields; but calling Acc(address) returns (uint unlockTime, uint balance) in multiple-return form; read balance by accessing second element pattern via ABI decode is not possible here. Instead call the getter and capture tuple.
        // To adhere to constraints and Solidity syntax, read via tuple
